@startuml SEQ_04_MENGELOLA_MODUL
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-04: Mengelola Modul Praktikum

actor       "Admin / Asisten"          as User
boundary    "Browser"                  as Browser
control     "ModulPraktikumController" as Controller
entity      "ModulPraktikum Model"     as Model
database    "modul_praktikum"          as DB

== Lihat Daftar Modul ==

User    -> Browser     : Buka tab Modul di halaman praktikum
Browser -> Controller  : GET /praktikum/{id}/modul
Controller -> Model    : Query modul berdasarkan praktikum
Model -> DB            : SELECT modul_praktikum WHERE praktikum_id = ?
DB      --> Model      : Data modul
Model --> Controller   : Data modul
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman daftar modul
Browser --> User       : Tampil daftar modul: nama, pertemuan, link share (jika aktif)

== Upload / Tambah Modul ==

User    -> Browser     : Klik "Upload Modul", pilih pertemuan, isi judul, upload file
Browser -> Controller  : POST /praktikum/{id}/modul {pertemuan_id, judul, file}
Controller -> Model    : create({pertemuan_id, judul, file_path})
Model -> DB            : INSERT INTO modul_praktikum
DB      --> Model      : Data modul baru
Model --> Controller   : Data modul baru
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser --> User       : Modul baru muncul di daftar

== Edit Modul ==

User    -> Browser     : Klik "Edit", ubah judul / ganti file
Browser -> Controller  : PUT /praktikum/{id}/modul/{modulId} {judul, file?}
Controller -> Model    : update({judul, file_path})
Model -> DB            : UPDATE modul_praktikum SET ... WHERE id = {id}
DB      --> Model      : Berhasil
Model --> Controller   : Berhasil
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser --> User       : Data modul ter-update

== Hapus Modul ==

User    -> Browser     : Klik "Hapus", konfirmasi
Browser -> Controller  : DELETE /praktikum/{id}/modul/{modulId}
Controller -> Model    : delete()
Model -> DB            : DELETE FROM modul_praktikum WHERE id = {id}
DB      --> Model      : Berhasil
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser --> User       : Modul hilang dari daftar

== Toggle Share Link ==

User    -> Browser     : Klik toggle "Bagikan" / "Hentikan Berbagi"
Browser -> Controller  : POST /praktikum/{id}/modul/{modulId}/toggle-share
Controller -> Model    : Query modul
Model -> DB            : SELECT modul_praktikum WHERE id = {id}
DB      --> Model      : Data modul
Model --> Controller   : Data modul
alt Belum dibagikan
  Controller -> Model : update({hash: random_string})
  Model -> DB         : UPDATE modul_praktikum SET hash = ? WHERE id = {id}
  DB --> Model        : Berhasil
else Sudah dibagikan
  Controller -> Model : update({hash: null})
  Model -> DB         : UPDATE modul_praktikum SET hash = NULL WHERE id = {id}
  DB --> Model        : Berhasil
end
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser --> User       : Status sharing ter-update

@enduml
